      "[Illithien Aerie, Garden]"
    ],
    "description": [
      "Fragrant wisteria envelops the encircling wall, its perimeter broken at opposite ends by a scrollworked copper gate and a circular platform.  Towering over a wrought imflass bench, an ancient thanot stands watch over rows of cultivated flowerbeds.  Starlight bathes the garden in an ethereal glow, and dew glimmers on a ring of toadstools emerging from lush moss underfoot.  The mountain continues its ascent from the plateau along one side, where a rosy glass door is set within the exposed cliff face."
    ],
